                            <comment id="14543032" author="jonathak" created="Thu, 14 May 2015 01:05:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yet another discrepancy I just noticed: though the hive and angular interpreter processes both correctly stop when the server is stopped, only the hive PID file is deleted.  The angular PID file sticks around, even though the process stops.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
